      "text": "---\nname: trace-csv\ndescription: Trace rounding and invalid CSV data during ordinary changes.\n---\n\nRead rounding.md before investigating a rounded total. Ordinary review follows employer CONTRIBUTING.md.\n"
    },
    "skills/trace-csv-v2/rounding.md": {
